#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:154
msgid ""
"Rework color-tracking code to pass color thresholds to ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` and iterate the flat blob-tuple list (:ref:`the "
"find_blobs rewrite <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Retravailler le code de suivi de couleur pour passer des seuils de couleur à"
" ``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` et parcourir la liste plate de tuples"
" de blob (:ref:`la réécriture de find_blobs <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"Read centroid / orientation / pixel data from the blob tuples instead of the"
" removed standalone methods (:ref:`the removed image methods "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`)."
msgstr ""
"Lire les données de centroïde / orientation / pixel à partir des tuples de "
"blob au lieu des méthodes autonomes supprimées (:ref:`les méthodes d'image "
"supprimées <v1_4_0_removed>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rename ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, fix ``blend()`` calls,"
" and replace ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`the imlib renames "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renommer ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, corriger les appels "
"``blend()`` et remplacer ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`les "
"renommages imlib <v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`the find_eye rename "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) and ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`the compress"
" rename <v1_4_0_compress>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renommer ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`le renommage de find_eye "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) et ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`le renommage "
"de compress <v1_4_0_compress>`)."

